#: ../../development/index.rst:5
msgid "Development"
msgstr "开发指南"

#: ../../development/index.rst:7
msgid ""
"Origin is an open-source platform, developed by Poly-Gamma, providing "
"distribution channel monitoring, protection, and monetization. Origin "
"Android SDK is a pure Java implementation for interacting with the *header* "
"module of the Origin Platform. The header platform module provides "
"distribution channel facing capabilities."
msgstr ""
"Origin 是由 Poly-Gamma 开发的开源平台，提供分发渠道监控、安全防护和变现能力。"
"Origin Android SDK 基于纯 Java 实现，用于与 Origin 平台的 *header* 模块进行交互。"
"header 平台模块提供面向分发渠道的相关能力。"

#: ../../development/testing.rst:4
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "测试"

#: ../../development/testing.rst:6
msgid ""
"The Origin SDK must support Android API level `19` and above, with only base "
"AOSP features. Each SDK module defines thorough tests validating against "
"different API levels. Currently the following API levels are validated "
"against."
msgstr ""
"Origin SDK 必须支持 Android API Level `19` 及以上版本，并且仅依赖 AOSP 基础功能。"
"每个 SDK 模块均定义了完整测试流程，用于验证不同 API Level 下的兼容性。"
"目前已验证以下 API Level："

