#: ../../development/testing.rst:21
msgid ""
"The `phonesGroupCheck` test group runs tests on API levels `27` and above "
"*only*. For validating against all API levels, devices must be added "
"manually."
msgstr ""
"`phonesGroupCheck` 测试组仅在 API Level `27` 及以上版本运行测试。"
"如果需要验证所有 API Level，则必须手动添加设备。"

